    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970424.0041\n\nALGIERS, April 24 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Paper reports new massacre of 42 people in Algeria\n\n\n\n\nA total 42 people were slain in a village in the Medea region south of the capital overnight Tuesday to Wednesday, the daily El Watan newspaper said on Thursday.",
